{"releases":[{"id":"the-beast-awoke-to-eat-your-darlings","name":"The Beast Awoke To Eat Your Darlings","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 27, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/the-beast-awoke-to-eat-your-darlings/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/the-beast-awoke-to-eat-your-darlings.jpg","platform":"pc"},{"id":"isles-of-arcana","name":"Isles of Arcana","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 27, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/isles-of-arcana/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/isles-of-arcana.jpg","platform":"pc"},{"id":"4-penny-coffins","name":"4 Penny Coffins","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 27, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/4-penny-coffins/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/4-penny-coffins.jpg","summary":"Unearthly terror stalks the winding alleys and rotting byways of 1888 Whitechapel. You are a motley collection of good-hearted citizens patrolling these haunted streets. But one among you is something else: the Ripper, a gleeful demon concealed behind a facade of humanity, possessing a tortured soul... and waiting for their next moment to feast. \n\n4 Penny Coffins blends first-person horror, manipulation, and detective work, setting the unfolding drama in the gorgeous, sinister backdrop of Victorian London at night. Each evening follows a deliberate three-phase cycle. The Ripper hunts. Players investigate. Then, in a formal and organised Conviction phase, evidence is weighed and a verdict is delivered. No endless shouting. No stalled discussions. Every round reaches a resolution.\n\nWith dynamic roles and player-driven outcomes, every session unfolds differently. Playable solo or in multiplayer, 4 Penny Coffins blends social deduction with investigative mechanics to create tense, unpredictable matches where trust is earned slowly and lost instantly. \n\nSomeone will hang for these crimes. Make sure it isn’t you.","platform":"pc"},{"id":"slop-simulator","name":"Slop Simulator","releaseDate":"2026-